 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Preposition + relative",
     "texto": [
      "The preposition goes right before the relative: **Das Buch, über das wir sprechen** (the book we talk about). **Der Film, von dem alle sprechen** (the film everyone talks about). **Die Person, mit der ich arbeite** (the person I work with).",
      "With «über» + neuter we use **das**; with «von» + masculine, **dem**; with «mit» + feminine, **der**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What to ask about",
     "texto": [
      "In German this type of clause is used a lot instead of such English forms as \"of which\" or \"with whom\". If you don't know the preposition, remember the verb: **sprechen über** (to talk about), **arbeiten mit** (to work with), **denken an** (to think about)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
